              "traits": "Match the exact blue Lapras source pose and color pattern. CRITICAL SOURCE MARKINGS: copy every clearly visible DARK BLUE oval spot as its own filled patch, not a shadow: one high on the neck below the head, another lower on the neck, and the separate dark-blue spots beside and below the shell on the blue body. The long neck must be visibly spotted, never a smooth plain-blue tube. Keep the gentle face, paired head ears, cream underside, brown ridged shell and four separate flippers. Do not replace the neck spots with shell texture, grass or rock marks."
